WEBVTT

00:00:10.594 --> 00:00:12.378
[ caws]

00:00:18.297 --> 00:00:20.734
[ caws]

00:00:29.352 --> 00:00:33.008
♪

00:00:35.923 --> 00:00:37.664
[ squawks]

00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:39.666
Ha!

00:00:39.710 --> 00:00:41.059
Whoo-hoo!

00:00:41.103 --> 00:00:45.063
Whoo-hoo...

00:00:45.107 --> 00:00:47.065
Whoo-hoo!

00:00:47.109 --> 00:00:48.980
Whoa!

00:00:57.902 --> 00:01:00.252
[ whistles]

00:01:08.869 --> 00:01:11.263
♪

00:01:11.307 --> 00:01:12.873
[ indistinct voices]

00:01:12.917 --> 00:01:14.701
Well done, Harry!

00:01:14.745 --> 00:01:16.312
[ applause]

00:01:16.355 --> 00:01:17.878
Well done, Harry!

00:01:17.922 --> 00:01:19.532
And well done, Buckbeak!

00:01:19.576 --> 00:01:22.057
Oh, that was
wicked, Harry!

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:23.449
Oh, please!

00:01:23.493 --> 00:01:25.712
Well done, well done.

00:01:25.756 --> 00:01:26.974
[ grunts]

00:01:27.018 --> 00:01:28.846
How am I doing me first day?

00:01:28.889 --> 00:01:31.109
Brilliant... Professor.

00:01:31.979 --> 00:01:33.285
[ grunts]

00:01:33.329 --> 00:01:36.114
Yes. You're not dangerous
at all, are you,

00:01:36.158 --> 00:01:37.115
you great ugly brute?

00:01:37.159 --> 00:01:38.769
Malfoy![ grunting]

00:01:38.812 --> 00:01:40.553
No![ screaming]

00:01:40.597 --> 00:01:41.424
Whoa!

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:42.816
[ yells]

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:44.514
Buckbeak!

00:01:44.557 --> 00:01:45.602
[ squawking]

00:01:45.645 --> 00:01:46.951
Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!

00:01:46.994 --> 00:01:48.605
Whoa! Buckbeak!

00:01:48.648 --> 00:01:49.954
[ caws]

00:01:49.997 --> 00:01:51.303
Away, you silly creature.

00:01:51.347 --> 00:01:53.262
DRACO:
Oh, it's killed me!

00:01:53.305 --> 00:01:54.480
It's killed me!

00:01:54.524 --> 00:01:55.438
Calm down!

00:01:55.481 --> 00:01:56.526
It's-it's just a scratch!

00:01:56.569 --> 00:01:57.744
[ shouting]:
Hagrid!

00:01:57.788 --> 00:01:59.181
He has to be taken
to the hospital.

00:01:59.224 --> 00:02:01.139
I'm the teacher.
I'll do it.

00:02:01.183 --> 00:02:03.315
[ whimpers]

00:02:03.359 --> 00:02:04.360
[ grunts]

00:02:04.403 --> 00:02:05.448
[ whimpering]:
Oh!

00:02:05.491 --> 00:02:07.145
Oh, you're gonna
regret this.

00:02:07.189 --> 00:02:08.364
Class dismissed!

00:02:08.407 --> 00:02:10.975
You and your bloody chicken!

00:02:11.018 --> 00:02:13.934
[ Draco whimpers]

00:02:14.413 --> 00:02:16.676
[ murmuring voices]

00:02:19.505 --> 00:02:22.726
[ low grunting]

00:02:23.205 --> 00:02:26.251
[ yelling]

00:02:26.295 --> 00:02:28.949
[ neighs]

00:02:31.343 --> 00:02:33.389
[ whinnying]

00:02:33.432 --> 00:02:34.955
[ shouting]

00:02:34.999 --> 00:02:37.175
PANSY PARKINSON:
Does it hurt terribly, Draco?

00:02:37.219 --> 00:02:38.524
DRACO:
It comes and it goes.

00:02:38.568 --> 00:02:40.178
Still, I consider
myself lucky.

00:02:40.222 --> 00:02:43.007
According to Madam Pomfrey,
another minute or two,

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:44.356
and I, uh,
could've lost my arm.

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:46.793
I couldn't possibly do
any homework for weeks.

00:02:46.837 --> 00:02:48.186
Listen to the idiot.

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:49.535
He's really laying
it on thick, isn't he?

00:02:49.579 --> 00:02:50.841
DRACO:
Please! Don't touch it.

00:02:50.884 --> 00:02:52.408
Yeah, but at least
Hagrid didn't get fired.

00:02:52.451 --> 00:02:54.671
Yeah, but I heard
Draco's father's furious.

00:02:54.714 --> 00:02:56.194
We haven't heard
the end of this.

00:02:56.238 --> 00:02:57.369
SEAMUS:
He's been sighted!

00:02:57.413 --> 00:02:58.892
He's been sighted!Who?

00:02:58.936 --> 00:02:59.850
Sirius Black!

00:02:59.893 --> 00:03:01.330
[ gasping]

00:03:01.373 --> 00:03:02.418
Dufftown?!

00:03:02.461 --> 00:03:04.028
That's not far
from here.

00:03:04.071 --> 00:03:06.552
Y-You don't think he'd come
to Hogwarts, do you?

00:03:06.596 --> 00:03:08.250
With dementors
at every entrance?!

00:03:08.293 --> 00:03:11.427
Dementors! He's already slipped
past them once, hasn't he?

00:03:11.470 --> 00:03:13.646
Who is to say
he won't do it again?

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:14.604
That's right.

00:03:14.647 --> 00:03:16.171
Black could
be anywhere.

00:03:16.214 --> 00:03:18.390
It's like trying
to catch smoke.

00:03:18.434 --> 00:03:20.523
Like trying
to catch smoke

00:03:20.566 --> 00:03:22.220
with your
bare hands.

00:03:22.264 --> 00:03:26.659
[ foreboding music plays]

00:03:32.143 --> 00:03:33.884
♪

00:03:33.927 --> 00:03:36.626
[ bird calls]

00:03:36.669 --> 00:03:41.021
[ distorted whooshing]

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:47.985
[ rumbling]

00:03:48.028 --> 00:03:51.336
LUPIN:
Intriguing, isn't it?

00:03:52.990 --> 00:03:57.560
Would anyone like to venture
a guess as to what is inside?

00:03:57.603 --> 00:04:00.780
DEAN THOMAS:
That's a boggart, that is.

00:04:00.824 --> 00:04:02.391
Very good,
Mr. Thomas.

00:04:02.434 --> 00:04:04.044
[ thudding]

00:04:04.088 --> 00:04:06.569
Now, can anybody tell me
what a boggart looks like?

00:04:06.612 --> 00:04:07.744
HERMIONE:
No one knows.

00:04:07.787 --> 00:04:08.745
When'd she get here?!

00:04:08.788 --> 00:04:10.094
Boggarts are
shape-shifters.

00:04:10.137 --> 00:04:11.574
They take the shape
of whatever

00:04:11.617 --> 00:04:13.445
a particular person
fears the most.

00:04:13.489 --> 00:04:14.751
That's what makes
them so...

00:04:14.794 --> 00:04:17.362
So terrifying.
Yes. Yes, yes, yes.

00:04:17.406 --> 00:04:18.929
[ thudding]

00:04:18.972 --> 00:04:23.368
Luckily, a very simple charm
exists to repel a boggart.

00:04:23.412 --> 00:04:25.109
[ thudding]

00:04:25.152 --> 00:04:26.980
Let's practice it now.

00:04:27.024 --> 00:04:29.592
Uh, without wands, please.

00:04:29.635 --> 00:04:30.767
After me:

00:04:30.810 --> 00:04:32.116
Riddikulus!

00:04:32.159 --> 00:04:33.422
ALL:
Riddikulus!

00:04:33.465 --> 00:04:34.684
Very good.

00:04:34.727 --> 00:04:36.033
A little louder
and very clear.

00:04:36.076 --> 00:04:37.077
Listen.

00:04:37.121 --> 00:04:38.122
Riddikulus.

00:04:38.165 --> 00:04:39.297
ALL:
Riddikulus!

00:04:39.341 --> 00:04:40.820
This class is ridiculous.

00:04:40.864 --> 00:04:42.953
Very good! Well, so
much for the easy part.

00:04:42.996 --> 00:04:45.956
You see, the incantation
alone is not enough.

00:04:45.999 --> 00:04:49.525
What really finishes
a boggart is... laughter.

00:04:49.568 --> 00:04:52.484
You need to force it
to assume a shape

00:04:52.528 --> 00:04:53.964
you find truly amusing.

00:04:54.007 --> 00:04:56.053
Let me explain.
Uh, Neville.

00:04:56.096 --> 00:04:57.620
Will you join
me, please?

00:04:57.663 --> 00:04:58.925
[ thudding]

00:04:58.969 --> 00:04:59.970
Come on.

00:05:00.013 --> 00:05:02.233
Don't be shy.
Come on.

00:05:02.277 --> 00:05:04.235
Come on.

00:05:04.279 --> 00:05:05.628
Hello.

00:05:05.671 --> 00:05:07.847
Neville, what frightens
you most of all?

00:05:07.891 --> 00:05:10.110
[ low stammering]

00:05:10.154 --> 00:05:11.329
Sorry?

00:05:11.373 --> 00:05:12.635
Professor Snape.[ laughing]

00:05:12.678 --> 00:05:13.897
[ chuckling]:
Professor Snape?

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:15.377
Yes. Frightens all.

00:05:15.420 --> 00:05:16.987
And I believe you live
with your grandmother.

00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:18.162
Y-Yes.
But I don't want

00:05:18.205 --> 00:05:19.903
that boggart to turn
into her either.

00:05:19.946 --> 00:05:21.513
[ laughing]No.

00:05:21.557 --> 00:05:22.645
[ thudding]

00:05:22.688 --> 00:05:23.994
It won't.

00:05:24.037 --> 00:05:25.996
I want you to
picture her clothes--

00:05:26.039 --> 00:05:27.171
only her clothes--

00:05:27.214 --> 00:05:28.825
very clearly,
in your mind.

00:05:28.868 --> 00:05:30.653
She carries
a red handbag.

00:05:30.696 --> 00:05:32.002
We don't need to hear.

00:05:32.045 --> 00:05:34.352
As long as you see it,
we'll see it.

00:05:34.396 --> 00:05:35.919
Now, when I open
that wardrobe,

00:05:35.962 --> 00:05:37.964
here's what I
want you to do.

00:05:38.008 --> 00:05:39.488
Excuse me.

00:05:39.531 --> 00:05:41.707
[ whispering]:
Imagine Professor Snape

00:05:41.751 --> 00:05:43.143
in your grandmother's clothes.

00:05:43.187 --> 00:05:44.884
[ aloud]:
Can you do that?

00:05:44.928 --> 00:05:46.277
[ clattering]

00:05:46.321 --> 00:05:47.060
Yes.

00:05:47.104 --> 00:05:48.453
Wand at the ready.

00:05:48.497 --> 00:05:51.282
One... two...

00:05:51.326 --> 00:05:53.110
three.

00:05:54.198 --> 00:05:56.156
[ creaking]

